@topic BUFSIZ
@keys BUFSIZ
 BUFSIZ

 The size of the buffer used by setbuf.

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic Console colors
@keys Console colors
 Console colors

 Constants for textcolor, textbackground and textattr: BLACK 0, BLUE
 1, GREEN 2, CYAN 3, RED 4, MAGENTA 5, BROWN 6, LIGHTGRAY 7, DARKGRAY
 8, LIGHTBLUE 9, LIGHTGREEN 10, LIGHTCYAN 11, LIGHTRED 12,
 LIGHTMAGENTA 13, YELLOW 14, WHITE 15, BLINK 128 (add to the
 foreground). Backgrounds use 0 to 7. Text modes: BW40 0, C40 1, BW80
 2, C80 3, MONO 7, C4350 64, LASTMODE -1. Cursor types: _NOCURSOR 0,
 _SOLIDCURSOR 1, _NORMALCURSOR 2.

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic EOF
@keys EOF
 EOF

 A negative integer constant (-1) returned by input functions at end
 of file or on error.

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic EXIT_SUCCESS
@keys EXIT_SUCCESS
 EXIT_SUCCESS

 Values for exit and for the result of main: EXIT_SUCCESS (0) and
 EXIT_FAILURE (1).

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic FILE
@keys FILE
 FILE

 A type that describes a stream. Streams are used through pointers:
 FILE *. Do not copy a FILE object.

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic FILENAME_MAX
@keys FILENAME_MAX
 FILENAME_MAX

 The largest size of a file name that the library handles.

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic FOPEN_MAX
@keys FOPEN_MAX
 FOPEN_MAX

 The number of files that can be open at the same time (at least 8).

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic HUGE_VAL
@keys HUGE_VAL
 HUGE_VAL

 The value returned by math functions on overflow (positive infinity,
 or the largest double).

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic Keywords and operators
@keys keyword operator precedence if else for while do switch case default break continue goto return sizeof struct union enum typedef static extern register volatile const signed unsigned void char short int long float double auto
@alias C keywords
 Keywords and operators

 Keywords
   auto break case char const continue default do double else enum
   extern float for goto if int long register return short signed
   sizeof static struct switch typedef union unsigned void volatile
   while

 The words near, far, huge, cdecl and pascal are accepted and ignored.

 Operators, highest precedence first
   () [] -> .                       left to right
   ! ~ ++ -- + - * & (type) sizeof  right to left
   * / %                            left to right
   + -
   << >>
   < <= > >=
   == !=
   &    ^    |
   &&   ||
   ?:                               right to left
   = += -= *= /= %= &= ^= |= <<= >>=
   ,                                left to right

 See {Preprocessor}, {Language reference}

@topic L_tmpnam
@keys L_tmpnam
 L_tmpnam

 The size of an array that is large enough to hold a name made by
 tmpnam.

 Back to {Library functions}

