@topic Library: conio and dos
@keys conio dos bios console
 Library: conio and dos

 Console input and output (<conio.h>), DOS-style time and delay functions
 (<dos.h>) and a few BIOS-style functions (<bios.h>).
 Console output uses ANSI terminal sequences; keyboard input is unbuffered.

 <conio.h>
  {_setcursortype} {cgets} {clreol} {clrscr} {cprintf} {cputs} {cscanf}
  {delline} {getch} {getche} {getpass} {gettextinfo} {gotoxy}
  {highvideo} {insline} {kbhit} {lowvideo} {normvideo} {putch}
  {textattr} {textbackground} {textcolor} {textmode} {ungetch} {wherex}
  {wherey} {window}

 <dos.h>
  {delay} {dostounix} {getdate} {getdfree} {getpid} {gettime} {nosound}
  {setdate} {settime} {sleep} {sound} {unixtodos} {unlink}

 <bios.h>
  {biosequip} {bioskey} {biosmemory} {biostime}

 Types and constants
  {text_info} {Console colors} {directvideo}
  {struct date} {struct time} {struct dfree}

 DOS interrupts, ports, far memory and graphics are not available: see
 {Not supported DOS features}.

