 A pointer to the structure.

 See also: {localtime} {mktime}

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic gotoxy
@keys gotoxy
 gotoxy

 Moves the cursor inside the text window.

 Header: conio.h

 Syntax
   void gotoxy(int x, int y);

 x and y count from 1 at the top left corner of the window. Positions
