 See also: {wherex} {wherey} {window}

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic highvideo
@keys highvideo
 highvideo

 Selects high intensity characters.

 Header: conio.h

 Syntax
   void highvideo(void);

 Sets the intensity bit of the text colour.

 Return value
 Nothing.

 See also: {lowvideo} {normvideo} {textcolor}

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic insline
@keys insline
 insline

 Inserts a blank line at the cursor.

 Header: conio.h

 Syntax
   void insline(void);

 Lines below move down; the bottom line of the window is lost.

