@keys putc
 putc

 Writes a character to a stream.

 Header: stdio.h

 Syntax
   int putc(int c, FILE *stream);

 Same as fputc; it may be implemented as a macro, so the arguments
 must not have side effects.

 Return value
 The character written, or EOF on error.

 See also: {fputc} {putchar}

 Back to {Library functions}

@topic putch
@keys putch
 putch

 Writes a character to the text window.

