 struct tm

 Broken-down time: int tm_sec, tm_min, tm_hour, tm_mday, tm_mon
 (0-11), tm_year (since 1900), tm_wday (0-6, Sunday is 0), tm_yday
 (0-365), tm_isdst.

 Back to {Library functions}

